  "evidencia": "Page: Emily Beecham. Sentence: Emily Beecham is an English-American actress.\nPage: Emily Beecham. Sentence: She is best known for her role in the AMC television series \"Into the Badlands\".\nPage: Into the Badlands (TV series). Sentence: Into the Badlands is an American television series that premiered on AMC November 15, 2015.\nPage: Into the Badlands (TV series). Sentence: AMC renewed the show for a 10-episode second season, which premiered on March 19, 2017.\nPage: The Calling (2009 film). Sentence: Dunn's third feature film, it tells the story of Joanna, played by Emily Beecham, who after graduating from university, goes against her family and friends when she decides to join the closed order of Benedictine nuns. For her debut leading performance in the film, Beecham was awarded a New Talent Trailblazer Award presented by Sean Connery during the film's debut, where it was also selected as 'Best of the Fest' at the 2009 Edinburgh International Film Festival.",
