        "original_id": "6d91f1ab-f8bb-55d1-a1ee-4e1c0dc983e5",
        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- People: Emily Beecham, Sean Connery, Jan Dunn\n- Works: Into the Badlands, The Calling\n- Organizations: AMC, Edinburgh International Film Festival\n- Roles: Joanna\n- Topics: acting awards, television premieres\n\nFacts:\n- In 2009, Jan Dunn's third feature film The Calling starred Emily Beecham as Joanna, a university graduate who chooses to join a closed order of Benedictine nuns against the wishes of her family and friends.\n- In 2009, Emily Beecham won a New Talent Trailblazer Award for her debut leading performance in The Calling, and Sean Connery presented the award during the film's debut.\n- In 2009, The Calling was selected as Best of the Fest at the Edinburgh International Film Festival.\n- On November 15, 2015, AMC premiered the American television series Into the Badlands.\n- On March 19, 2017, AMC premiered the 10-episode second season of Into the Badlands after renewing the series.\n- Emily Beecham is an English-American actress.\n- Emily Beecham is best known for her role in AMC's television series Into the Badlands.",
